@startuml comm-dispense
' UML communication diagram: "Dispense medication" (FR-PHA-03/04) — one MongoDB transaction.
!pragma layout smetana
allowmixing
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam object {
  BackgroundColor #EFFCF9
  BorderColor #088577
}
left to right direction

actor ":Pharmacist" as P
object ":Pharmacy UI" as UI
object ":ClinicalController" as Ctl
object ":PharmacyService" as Svc
object ":Session (transaction)" as Tx
object ":Prescription" as Rx
object ":Medication" as Med
object ":QueueService" as QS
object ":Visit" as Visit
object ":Appointment" as Appt

P --> UI : 1: Dispense & complete
UI --> Ctl : 2: POST /pharmacy/prescriptions/:id/dispense
Ctl --> Svc : 3: dispense(rxId, lines)
Svc --> Tx : 4: startTransaction
Svc --> Rx : 5: load & check status
Svc --> Med : 6*: [each item] decrement stock if stockQty ≥ qty
Svc --> Rx : 7: set dispensedQty, status
Svc --> QS : 8: moveToStage(pharmacy → done)
QS --> Visit : 9: complete visit
QS --> Appt : 10: appointment → completed
Svc --> Tx : 11: commit (or abort on insufficient stock)
Ctl --> UI : 12: 200 / 409
@enduml
